{"parse": {"title": "PD-08", "pageid": 144777, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/PD-07\" title=\"PD-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">PD-08</span><a href=\"/wiki/PD-09\" title=\"PD-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">PD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.AC.B2.E7.96.AF.E7.8B.82.E8.80.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"欲疯狂者\">欲疯狂者</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 欲疯狂者</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Crazy-to-Be</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>里<span class=\"color-value\"></span>禁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>止<span class=\"color-value\"></span>感<span class=\"color-value\"></span>伤<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 38510109</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_06\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-s02_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-s02_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-s02_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>聚合物展览馆中异常热闹，P-3和双生舞伶在进行着另一番“战斗”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-650716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-650716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-650716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>十几分钟前还不是这样的！他之前还很正常，为什么突然疯了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-650716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-650716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-650716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>分别抱住他的腿，双生舞伶！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-314901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-314901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-314901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶&amp;右伶：</div><div>收到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科学家Ⅲ：</div><div>放——放开我——啊——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>这是我来这里之后疯掉的第几名科学家？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>根据目前已统计的数据，这是第七位精神陷入异常情况的科学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>焦巴脆！左伶！我们真的不能从哪里弄点镇静剂吗？这玩意维修小站能不能做？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>我们的维修小站出了点问题……情绪问题，P-3少校。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>好吧好吧，医者难自医。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>系好最后一个结后，P-3从实验台上跳了下来，擦了擦汗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>呼！可算把他绑好了，谢了，双生舞伶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>真没看出来他们劲儿这么大，还是杀人比较简单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>请注意用词，P-3少校，你这次的任务是阻止事态发展成国际外交丑闻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>如果没人知道这件事，那也算一种完成任务了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>你可闭嘴吧，我从来没想过要把人都杀了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>清点一下待办事件吧。就像玩轮盘赌，剩下的这些人现在看起来还算正常，可不知道什么时候，“啪”一下就疯了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>那三个跑掉的小朋友和未知原因启动的炸肉包也不知道去哪里了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>噢！我差点忘记问了……右伶，你之前调查得怎么样了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>名单中有四名受邀人身份不匹配，除了已知的三名未成年人外，还有一名记者身份存疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-650716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-650716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-650716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>什么声音？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>警告，巨大热源靠近中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-650713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-650713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-650713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>识别机型代码为——MA-9“炸肉包”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-650714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-650714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-650714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>是自行启动的那台吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>装配间的透明玻璃映出模糊的巨大身影，其头部数十双眼睛紧盯着众人，仿佛要在玻璃中熔出数个孔洞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“呲——”防护密闭门缓缓打开，双生舞伶弹出钢爪，P-3也握枪做出警备的姿势。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>钢铁巨物于门后尽然展现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-652401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-652401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-652401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">炸肉包：</div><div>“啊，请不要伤害我。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>炸肉包高举着双臂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-652401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-652401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-652401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">炸肉包：</div><div>“我有话要说——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-650714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-650714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-650714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_06\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-s02_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-s02_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-s02_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>炸肉包一改曾经凶猛的态势，正瘫在墙角，接受着左伶细致无比的检查。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>你们的意思是，你们查出幕后黑手是那个叫马克西姆的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是的，我们带回来的资料和炸肉包数据库的篡改痕迹可以证明这件事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>他们带回来的那些资料呢，查尔斯，你能看懂吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>我在看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手套的卷须支撑着纸页，一行行地扫视着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>解析完毕，此台MA-9，也就是炸肉包的数据库确实存在两次修改痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>第一次登入修改的账号，通过它的破解路径，我们可以认定，这个人与我们在诺拉的记录中发现的那个异常访客相同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>第二次修改采用了一种已知技术无法解析的手段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>哈哈，那是我的……专利技术，国家级机密，解除的话，它又会回到马克西姆手中的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>你看看，炸肉包的破解路径是不是跟这上面写的一致？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>P-3将年轻访客们带回来的资料递给了左伶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>一致。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>目前基本可以认定，让诺拉失控、操控VOV-A6型实验助手杀人和启动MA-9炸肉包，这三件事背后的操纵者均为马克西姆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>综上可以判定，夺取展览馆控制权一事极大概率为马克西姆所为。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>他做的事可能不止这些，看，这里还有“思想”控制器的结构图纸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>他研究这个干嘛？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>查尔斯翻着资料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650718.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-650718.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650718.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650718.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-650718.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650718.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-650718.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650718.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>对“思想”控制器进行改装，也许是方便他远程控制那些被他修改过的机器人，也许是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650718.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-650718.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650718.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650718.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-650718.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650718.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-650718.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650718.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>方便他制造出一起足以操控……不，甚至是阻止“大集体2.0”开启的国际丑闻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>你的意思是，科学家们的发狂和死亡，也有可能是因为马克西姆在他们的“思想”控制器里动了手脚？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650718.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-650718.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650718.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650718.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-650718.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650718.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-650718.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650718.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>可能性非常大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>焦巴脆！揪出来问问就知道了！双生舞伶，帮我找找马克西姆在哪儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>无涡轮车起飞记录，推测马克西姆仍留在此飞行平台内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>或许我们可以从馆内的构造推测马克西姆所在之处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>双生舞伶，请告诉我哪里能掌握整个展览馆的情况，包括馆内的机器人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>综合各方面情报，排除已掉线区域……得出结论，能源室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们有办法向那里发起通话吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>可以，如果使用公共通讯系统的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>左伶的数据流迅速渗入能源室，终于在系统失控的情况下，找到了一丝缝隙——接通了能源室的通讯信号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>马克西姆先生，您好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>线路另一端没有任何回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>目前已知你夺取展览馆控制权、操纵各型号机器人，试图妨碍“大集体2.0”的展开，你的诉求是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>………………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>没有声音……他真的在那里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>马克西姆先生，我们必须再次提醒你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>马克西姆，我们知道你最近回过那栋小楼，我们也去过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>那里有你父亲使用过的工具，有你童年时期的玩具，有你的全家福。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>塔玛拉婆婆告诉我们，你的本名叫万尼亚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-650320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-650320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-650320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>……我记得你的声音，天才小科学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-650320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-650320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-650320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>现在几点了？多想想自己吧，估计你们离死亡并不远了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-650320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-650320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-650320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马克西姆：</div><div>这就是成为谢切诺夫拥趸的下场，别折腾了，就算杀了我也阻止不了什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通讯结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>这个疯子，他究竟想做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>至少我们的猜测得到了印证——他就在能源室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声惊呼打断了众人的讨论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652303.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652303.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊桑·布朗：</div><div>你没事吧？喂……快来个人看看！他情况不对……！阿列克谢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-624702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-624702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-624702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿列克谢：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>实验室的角落，幸存的科学家正拼尽全力地按住另一个同伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-650716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-650716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-650716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>我来！他怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652303.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652303.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊桑·布朗：</div><div>我不知道……刚才还好好的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-624702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-624702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-624702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿列克谢：</div><div>……绑住我……别让我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-650701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-650701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-650701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>唉，行……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊桑和P-3一起将阿列克谢扶到隔壁的房间，不一会儿，就听到了阿列克谢癫狂的喊叫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>P-3愤愤地活动着手腕，从隔壁走了回来，伊桑颓丧地跟在他的后面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>焦巴脆……得把马克西姆从能源室揪出来才行！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>你们在这里待好。双生舞伶，保护好他们，我去解决了那家伙！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶&amp;右伶：</div><div>刚才马克西姆在通信中说了一句——“就算杀了我也阻止不了什么”，因此我们并不建议贸然行动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>那怎么办！还能等着这里的人都疯了啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶&amp;右伶：</div><div>科学家们的发狂原因仍旧未知，若不知晓其机制，仍然无法阻止事态的恶化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>怒气冲冲的男人闻言，放缓了前进的脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-624702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-624702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-624702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿列克谢：</div><div>呃！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>室内所有人都陷入了沉默，只剩隔间传来的癫狂叫喊回荡在这片空间之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652303.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652303.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊桑·布朗：</div><div>我猜，是……是时间……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652303.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652303.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊桑·布朗：</div><div>恐怕我们刚植入的这一整批“思想”控制器都被他动了手脚，这里面也许有个计时器之类的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652303.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652303.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊桑·布朗：</div><div>现在发狂的顺序是按照“思想”控制器启动的先后顺序来的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X摸上了自己的“思想”控制器，思忖一会儿后，将手放了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652303.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652303.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-652303.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652303.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊桑·布朗：</div><div>也就是说……我可能很快也要发作了……我之后……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>也许是我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>众人惊诧地看向X，但他仍旧语调平稳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我也启动“思想”控制器了呀，这不是意料之中的事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……糟糕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……这可并不是我们期待的“影响与变动”，X。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉普拉斯的治疗师忍住了口冒更激烈话语的欲望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>虽然它让你深度参与了这个世界，但我们本就不该这样冒险，让你在这里发狂……不，应该说，失控。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我们的实验……不该这样进行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>——不，事情还没到这么悲观的地步，小梅斯梅尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X抬手，指了指太阳穴位置的“思想”控制器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>忘了吗？我们可是“科学家”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>而这里，正好需要一些具备科学和实验素养的人，来破解它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>等等，你是说——让我们来拆解出“思想”控制器的运行机制，阻止疯狂的蔓延？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>正是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女思忖片刻，最终只能无奈地点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>没想到我会赞同你……的确，再说“早该如此”也没有任何用了。现在我们要做到一切我们能做的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>还有什么好拆不拆的！焦巴脆！让我直接问问马克西姆不就行了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不行，P-3少校，我们需要有人留下来保护这里的科学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>而且，想要解决这次的危机，确实需要有人破解马克西姆改造的“思想”控制器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>查尔斯算是这里比较了解“思想”控制器的，我们非常需要你留在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>那谁去找马克西姆？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我、双生舞伶和炸肉包去能源室与马克西姆谈判，或许还可以想办法套出解决问题的方法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>别闹了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>这可不是什么暑假实践作业，一个不小心那些机器人真会把你的头拽下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>P-3少校，我们不会让这种事情发生的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小梅斯梅尔和X已经穿好了防护服，开始调整实验用护目镜的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>请放心，我还是幼童的时候就在手术台旁打下手了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>而我在拉普拉斯也工作不少年了……我们确实可以称得上是科学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小梅斯梅尔和X穿戴整齐，相视点头，走到了操作台旁，准备开始分析“思想”控制器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>好，好，我都忘记了，这里原来是要举办聚合物国际峰会的！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "PD-08"}}